Package: extracttext
Title: Court Record Text Extraction, Deterministic and AI Compared
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Tim", "Thomas", , "timthomas@berkeley.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Extracts structured fields from United States court records, most
    often eviction and unlawful detainer filings, using rule-based and language
    model methods, then reports where the two disagree. Wraps the Python
    extract_text engine through reticulate so that the Eviction Research Network
    state pipelines can call it directly. Records extracted with a local model
    never leave the machine.
